# bash.exe shim at estate root (wave5 fold-gate repair, 2026-09-29): Windows
# CreateProcess resolves bare `bash` to System32's WSL launcher before PATH, and
# the WSL default distro had no /bin/bash, so spawned shell gates died exit 1.
# This compiled forwarder to Git\bin\bash.exe sits in the harness cwd (searched
# before System32) and forwards argv + std handles verbatim. Source and receipt:
# watch/inbox/gala_20260925/wave5-repair/bash_shim_forwarder.cs and fold-gate-repair.md
/bash.exe


